cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "readme-3d"
abstract: "Put interactive, rotatable 3D models in your GitHub README. Converts GLB, glTF, OBJ, and binary STL into the ASCII STL markdown blocks GitHub renders natively - with mesh simplification to fit the 512 KB markdown budget."
version: 0.1.1
license: Apache-2.0
